Subject: [PATCH 27/39] AskData: show username, host-scoped My Players,
 platform-wide mode
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Show username (not full_name) throughout all player lists
- Pass hostName + hostEmail from AskData.jsx to /api/chat backend
- System prompt now has two separate sections:
  MY PLAYERS = only VIPs where host_assigned matches the logged-in user
  PLATFORM-WIDE = all VIPs regardless of host
- AI rules: "my / my gold / my players" → filter to MY PLAYERS section
  "whole platform / all players" → use PLATFORM-WIDE section
- Per-tier breakdown (GOLD/PLATINUM/DIAMOND) in both sections:
  top 10 by monthly_valid_bet + inactive list (days_inactive > 14)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
